      "originalText": "Called by external services\nwhen events occur:\n\n  POST /api/borzo/webhook\n       Delivery finished\n       → mark order delivered\n\n  POST /api/webhooks/razorpay\n       Payment confirmed\n       → confirm order\n\n  POST /api/webhooks/whatsapp\n       Incoming message\n       → WhatsApp ordering bot",
